#: ../../openmvcam/shields/pir-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/pir-shield.rst:6
msgid "PIR Shield"
msgstr "PIR Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/pir-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The PIR Shield wakes the OpenMV Cam from deep sleep on motion, draws an "
"ultra-low 6 µA in standby, and adds eight white plus eight 850 nm infrared "
"LEDs for illumination. Ideal for battery-powered surveillance and trail "
"cameras."
msgstr ""
"PIR Shield membangunkan OpenMV Cam dari deep sleep saat mendeteksi gerakan, "
"mengonsumsi arus sangat rendah sebesar 6 µA dalam mode standby, dan "
"menambahkan delapan LED putih serta delapan LED inframerah 850 nm untuk "
"pencahayaan. Ideal untuk kamera pengawas dan kamera jejak bertenaga baterai."

